<title>USA: Environmental Remediation names COO.</title>
<headline>Environmental Remediation names COO.</headline>
<dateline>BROUSSARD, La. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Environmental Remediation Holding Corp said Friday that it has named James Callender, currently a director, and formerly a manager at Unocal Corp, as chief operating officer for domestic and international operations.</p>
<p>The company said the position is newly-created.</p>
<p>Environmental Remediation is involved in oil and gas exploration, and in making old wells environmentally safe.</p>
